# Title: Local Groups Discovery - MacOs
# ID: 89bb1f97-c7b9-40e8-b52b-7d6afbd67276
# Status: test
# Level: informational
# Author: Ömer Günal, Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-11
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1069.001
# Description: Detects enumeration of local system groups
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*/dscacheutil AND (cmdline:*-q* AND cmdline:*group*)) OR (process_name:*/cat AND cmdline:*/etc/group*) OR (process_name:*/dscl AND (cmdline:*-list* AND cmdline:*/groups*)))
